    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Robert Filliou: Yes (Action Poem).",
      "links": [],
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Performance for poet and lecturer. The poet sits in a chair, silent and motionless. Behind him, the lecturer presents a fairly extensive lecture describing the body parts and bodily functions of the poet. After the lecture, the poet recites a brief poem stating his ideal of \"sitting quietly, doing nothing\".",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Performed in 1965 at the Café au Go-Go in New York by Robert Filliou (poet) and Alison Knowles (lecturer).",
      "links": []
    },
